{"version":1,"key":"card:147","content":{"id":147,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"74231371-3b6a-4bc0-b889-4c0e379254f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Insersection Observer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实现无限滚动。在列表的最后一项，放置一个元素，这个元素透明不可见，我们监听这个元素是否出现视口，如果出现在视口中，就说明滚动到底部，我们便请求新的数据，我们可以设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rootMargin"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，提前加载，使用户无感知。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"212cb278-a7f2-405e-8e07-d576364745a6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b3331966-855e-4bad-9636-fc5bdbd4a592","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id=\"goods\">\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n</div>\n// 用以控制是否加载新的数据\n<div id=\"footer\"></div>","collabId":"a4a49754-3eda-4ba7-9486-d0cdd35f0606","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"css","uuid":"65fdb7d2-03ac-4948-9867-398079c9c238","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1ab54773-b8e3-464c-abbf-599be679f43b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"#goods {\n  width: 320px;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin: 20px auto;\n}\n\n.good {\n  height: 150px;\n  background: deeppink;\n}\n\n#footer {\n  background: transparent;\n  height: 10px;\n}","collabId":"64973574-f7f3-4db9-a4d2-18ffa08466e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5ada1c47-5708-4e3f-bf11-f4852209d8e4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"54ef2e59-9aa7-4f69-9ea4-31eab0214837","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n  entries.forEach(entry => {\n    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n      loadMore(10);\n    }\n  });\n}, {\n  // 扩展视口的底部区域，提前加载\n  rootMargin: '0px 0px 100px 0px'\n});\n\nconst loadMore = (n) => {\n  let appendedGoods = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    appendedGoods += '<div class=\"good\"></div>'\n  }\n  const goods = document.getElementById('goods');\n  goods.innerHTML = goods.innerHTML + appendedGoods;\n}\n\nconst footer = document.getElementById('footer');\nobserver.observe(footer);","collabId":"b91ab47e-5875-4167-bced-96007029b146","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<video style=\"max-width: 100%;\" controls src=\"https://video-obsidian.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/IntersectionObserver-%E6%97%A0%E9%99%90%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD.mp4\"></video>","collabId":"d7eecf83-79bb-4518-81b7-3758cc293c9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer/技巧","技巧/Intersection Observer"],"createTime":1690124868776,"updateTime":1752924208663,"linkedCards":[{"id":145,"target":{"key":"card:145","type":"card","id":145},"summary":"使用 IntersectionObserver 可以监听元素是否出现在视口中，其使用方法如下 // 创建 observer，接收两个参数 // 1. fn，被监听的元素出现在视口中时触发的回调函数 // 2. 创建 observer 的选项...","tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924208663},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.11","categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"apiVersion":1,"format":"cjs","main":"main.js","styles":"main.css","skills":["authoring"],"integrity":{"main.js":"968d6dd4153a56e6a91e0990d98b68c75255776b56b323facc1bfd5037fe0602","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8","skills/authoring/SKILL.md":"5a476fc110584964ab053cb40f0399ec27125bc1d315b6d50b019fbd9b112aa0"},"formatVersion":3,"platform":"portable","profile":"web-v1","description":"在文档中编辑行内与块级 HTML，支持 Tailwind 样式、博客发布和静态导出。","targets":{"desktop":{"minAppVersion":"0.59.5"},"android":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"},"ios":{"minAppVersion":"0.2.7"}}},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.11/fc2c10e9d04101645a92fb3123d7d6c355005213fcb06e9f3dab58168bbab594/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../styles/55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654.css","integrity":"55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654"}]}